    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eikitok Yesu alang Musa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki nena, lo alashera sinyat, oong'ar enkipototo e shumata, entadamu Yesu, olkipaaret naa olapolosani kitok le na limunoto ang. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.12.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 12.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Etaa ninye oloisiligayu ti alo ilo otegelua ninye, anaa apa sii ninye Musa otaa oloisiligayu ti atua enkaji e Enkai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore ninye Yesu neikenakaki nchere keiririkino enkitoo nalang ene Musa anaa te neeta oloshetu enkaji enkitoo nalang ene nkaji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu eeta ake enkaji pooki oloteshetua kake Enkai olashetani loo ntokitin pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etaa apa Musa oloisiligayu, anaa olaisiaayiani te pooki naatii enkaji e Nkai, pee eishakenoki mbaa naanyaakaki aalimu te siadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake ore Kristo netaa oloisiligayu te nkaji e Enkai anaa Oinoti. Nikira iyiook enkaji enye ti nikimbung aakurraki empijan ang o lwuasa ti atua ilo siligi lang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enkiyeng'iyeng too ltung'ana le Enkai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entodol ate, lo alashera, pee metii ake atua intae likae linyi lo ltau torrono, lemeiruk, orik intae nesulaa neitapaash Enkai naishu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake entaretunoto anaa ake, anaa neton ejoitoi, “taata ena olong,” pee megolu likae linyi lukunya te nkaraki elejaroto oo ng'ok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu Kristo king'ar iyiook, te nesipa kikurraki aaibung empijan ang o meiting'o, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.95.7+PSA.95.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Olke 95.7-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " eton ejoitoi, “Ore taata ena olong, ti nining'ining'i oltoilo lenye, emintagol iltauja linyi anaa te napa gogong'i.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
