            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.14.1+NUM.14.2+NUM.14.3+NUM.14.4+NUM.14.5+NUM.14.6+NUM.14.7+NUM.14.8+NUM.14.9+NUM.14.10+NUM.14.11+NUM.14.12+NUM.14.13+NUM.14.14+NUM.14.15+NUM.14.16+NUM.14.17+NUM.14.18+NUM.14.19+NUM.14.20+NUM.14.21+NUM.14.22+NUM.14.23+NUM.14.24+NUM.14.25+NUM.14.26+NUM.14.27+NUM.14.28+NUM.14.29+NUM.14.30+NUM.14.31+NUM.14.32+NUM.14.33+NUM.14.34+NUM.14.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enki 14.1-35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kakua apa lelo ootoning'o neitoki aagolong'aki? Aime lapa pooki ootung'uaitie Misiri ootorikuo Musa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kakua etagorokine ninye too larin artam? Aime lelo ootaasa ng'ok, ooitanang'a seseni lenye ilo purkel? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kakua einosaka olmumai ajo, mejing enkiyeng'iyeng'ata enye ntarasi, ei kulikae leme lelo ootogolong'akita? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku kidol aajo eitu eidim ninche aatijing ine te nkaraki neitu eiruk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
